\title{Overwinter Survival of Mason Bees in Urban Nesting Blocks}
\author{H.~Brunet and A.~Castaneda}
\date{February 2026}

\begin{document}
\maketitle

\begin{abstract}
Nesting blocks were deployed on four garage walls across the city and checked monthly from October to April.
Figure~\ref{fig:boxes} shows the block layout.
Survival varied strongly with wall orientation and winter moisture.
\end{abstract}

Survival outcomes are summarized in Section~\ref{sec:winter}.

